{
  "_note": "Source of truth for VisKey colors. Sources: design/source/VisKey — Brand v1 (...).pdf p4 (scales, brand tokens) and design/source/VisKey — Brand & UI.pdf p1 (UI roles). Run Tools/gen-colors.py to emit Assets.xcassets colorsets.",
  "version": 2,
